evo-check --scene | --context | --bluetooth | --monitor [seconds 1..60] | --help
evo-check --dbus-names | --dbus-introspect <destination> <path> | --dbus-watch <path> [seconds 1..3600]
Read and watch only: no UUID, configuration, surface or TCP port.
--scene: IVI scene and candidate layers; each command is bounded to 2 seconds.
--context: video, MOST, audio and inputs, network, ports and firewall, read only.
--bluetooth: the Alps API, then spp_data_interface of instances 0 and 1.
--monitor: bounded watch (30 seconds by default), Ctrl-C to end it.
--dbus-names: system bus names, with the pid and command line of their process.
--dbus-introspect: XML description of one bus object.
--dbus-watch: messages on one bus path (60 seconds by default), arguments decoded.
